    "why": [
      "Elevates Soil Health Score to 57/100 (+30 pts vs. baseline) and changes 10-year topsoil organic carbon by +0.1 t C/ha, saving 1.9 bags/ha of 45-kg Urea via biological N fixation [RothC-lite \u00b7 SoilGrids].",
      "Provides a 34-day Kharif-to-Rabi turnaround window for Happy Seeder / zero-till sowing with in-situ residue mulching \u2014 eliminating Oct\u2013Nov stubble burning monitored by NASA FIRMS.",
      "Timely sowing schedule buffers crops against 139 annual extreme heat days (>35\u00b0C) and 40.6 March\u2013April terminal grain-filling heat days (>32\u00b0C) recorded by NASA POWER.",
      "Delivers median net operating return of \u20b9119,997/ha (\u20b948,561/acre) with a worst-10% drought downside buffer (CVaR-10) of \u20b993,223/ha (\u20b937,726/acre) [CACP MSP 2024-25]. Eligible schemes: Crop Diversification / Mera Pani Meri Virasat (\u20b917,500/ha state incentive); CRM Sub-Mission on Crop Residue Management (50\u201380% Happy Seeder / CHC subsidy)."
    ],
